<title>USA: Tandem Computers Inc Q2 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Tandem Computers Inc Q2 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.22     loss	 $0.42</p>
<p> Net profit		 25,993     loss	49,557</p>
<p> Revs			467,323		  469,941</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  120,249		  117,311</p>
<p>			6   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.31     loss	 $0.41</p>
<p> Net profit		 37,757     loss	47,591</p>
<p> Revs			903,055		  890,920</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  120,540		  117,152</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 and six months 1997 include $0.01/shr gain on disposal of discontinued opers.</p>
<p>1996 net includes results from discontinued opers of loss $0.02/shr for Q2 and profit $0.18/shr for six months.</p>
<p>Oper shr, excluding above items, is profit $0.21 vs loss $0.40 for Q2, and profit $0.30 vs loss $0.59 for six months.</p>
<p>Periods ended March 31.</p>
